{"reviewId": "254854030_87GErwymo", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "站在2010年这个长波衰退拐点上过去30年的繁荣里积累了很多虚假、不可持续的需求，比如靠大量放水、资产泡沫、透支未来形成的需求，这些并不是真正由技术进步和产业升级支撑的有效需求，未来20年全球经济要做的就是把这些虚高、过度的需求慢慢挤掉消化掉，同时去寻找和培育能带动下一轮大繁荣的新动力，比如重大技术革命、新产业、新的增长模式。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "未来20年就是要洗去过去30年繁荣中的过度需求成分，探索未来新的经济动力源，从而为下一次繁荣做好准备", "range": "1500-1550", "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "254854030_87GErwymo", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773794809, "userEditTime": 1789604416, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 8, "likes": [{"userVid": 211979211, "name": "蜡妹小欣", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/78EkX665csCnhF3ic21HRJFL2EIdUPG3xnKSoDSOFq5dmrETnQFpIK5e841j3n64vF2I2JlwUEKs/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "没有实体需求的